From dce83d81128bba63d9cd2968458d7bae91d932f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Provant15 <me@provant.dev>
Date: Sat, 7 Mar 2026 17:56:35 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 18/21] feat: add Minecraft players page with RCON integration

Add a real-time Players page for Minecraft servers backed by the Elytra
daemon's game bridge. Includes:

- PHP controller proxying player requests to Elytra with egg feature gate
- Players permission group (list, action, command) in Permission model
- Egg features in daemon sync payload for bridge configuration
- React players page with grid/list views and action menus
- WebSocket subscription for live player join/leave events
- Egg feature-based navigation gating in desktop and mobile sidebars
- RCON status badge showing connection state

